  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyDispatcher 1.3.0-beta.3\n\n      Added\n      - Opt-in generated pipeline structure through DispatcherPipelineMaps.Get().\n      - Attribute-backed pipeline maps preserving pipeline, context, command, middleware, and policy types.\n\n      Improved\n      - Generator diagnostics now point to the relevant source location for duplicate handlers, invalid middleware, pipeline configuration, and referenced-assembly conflicts.\n\n      Fixed\n      - Middleware declaration order is preserved within each generated pipeline layer.\n\n      Notes\n      - Pipeline-map generation is opt-in and does not affect dispatch when disabled.\n      - Reading pipeline maps does not dispatch operations, construct handlers, or execute middleware.\n      - 1.2.1 remains the current stable release.",
